<title>SINGAPORE: ST Aerospace 1996 net profit S$27.84.</title>
<headline>ST Aerospace 1996 net profit S$27.84.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit/(loss)	     27.84  vs    (48.35)</p>
<p>    Dividend (cts)		   2.50  vs	2.50</p>
<p>    Group shares (cts)	     9.30  vs    (16.10)</p>
<p>    Turnover			 523.39  vs    480.29</p>
<p>    Investment income		3.68  vs	1.32</p>
<p>    Other &amp; interest income     11.09  vs	3.41</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  56.40  vs    (45.07)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items		 nil  vs    (50.71)</p>
<p>    Associates			17.25  vs	7.08</p>
<p>    Tax				 27.35  vs	7.40</p>
<p>    Minorities			(1.21) vs	4.12</p>
<p>Note - Singapore Technologies Aerospace Ltd said it expects better performance in 1997.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
